"],"head_icon":"308001.png","audio":"610016395","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["而我自己，也尚且处于迷雾之中。我不曾拥有的真相，要如何给予他们？！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"115":{"step":[[115,116,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡卡尼亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308001.png","audio":"610016396","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——仅仅凭我，又该如何面对这些压倒性的疯狂和毁灭？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"116":{"step":[[116,117,""]],"type":1,"name":["？？？","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610016397","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>所以你只是一个恰好知道真相的人，一个恰好站在岸上的人！</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"117":{"step":[[117,118,""]],"type":1,"name":["？？？","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610016398","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>这便是属于你的耻辱。</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"118":{"step":[[118,119,""]],"type":1,"name":["？？？","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610016399","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>倘若你只是在一边看着，那就是犯罪；假如你给以承诺，却没有能力带他们上岸，你也是在犯罪；假如你狠心无视这一切，抽身离去，那更是最大的罪！</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"119":{"step":[[119,120,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡卡尼亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308001.png","audio":"610016400","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……是的，我承认。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"120":{"step":[[120,121,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡卡尼亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308001.png","audio":"610016401","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我承认，我是一个伪善的人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"121":{"step":[[121,122,""]],"type":1,"name":["卡卡尼亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308001.png","audio":"610016402","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我曾那么渴望帮助同